# Lyriq Environment Variables

# ============================================
# AI API Keys (Multi-Provider Support)
# ============================================
# The app supports multiple AI providers for rhyme suggestions and lyric assistance.
# Configure at least ONE of the following to enable AI features.
# Priority order: Gemini -> OpenAI -> Anthropic -> Grok

# OpenAI API Key (for GPT-4, transcription, etc.)
# Get your key: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
EXPO_PUBLIC_VIBECODE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Anthropic API Key (for Claude)
# Get your key: https://console.anthropic.com/
EXPO_PUBLIC_VIBECODE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# Google Gemini API Key (for rhyme suggestions - PRIMARY)
# Get your key: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
# FREE TIER: 60 requests/minute
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Grok API Key (optional)
# Get your key: https://console.x.ai/
EXPO_PUBLIC_GROK_API_KEY=your_grok_api_key_here

# ============================================
# Quick Start
# ============================================
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Add at least ONE API key above
# 3. Restart your Expo dev server: bun start --clear
# 4. You're ready to use AI-powered rhyme suggestions!

# Recommended for quick start: Gemini (free tier is generous)

# === Other Configuration ===
# Add any other environment variables here
